    "ruleNumber": "24.26",
    "summary": "Each **[[ONE SHOT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/one-shot)** weapon can make attacks only once per battle.\n\n- A **destroyed** model returned to its unit can't attack again with any such weapon it already used.\n- A unit newly added to the army gets 1 use of every **[[ONE SHOT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/one-shot)** weapon it has.",
